        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"4d44727e-d531-46a6-8bc5-a27e38928151\",\"review_text\":\"I love this app 😻😻\"},{\"review_id\":\"28f6a14f-9a2c-4259-a3b0-1978e0ee238e\",\"review_text\":\"Fed up with this app on mobile. Why would I pay for premium when they flat out lie about the ads and 30 minutes of ad free music? The ads are atrocious and intrusive as with any ads related to the non existent dystopian privacy we have geared to an individual nowadays. About to uninstall and just listen to music on a much better and established platform like YouTube. At least there I have more control over the ads and what I want to listen to on mobile.\"},{\"review_id\":\"06b9c934-dba4-47d0-b3de-6212a88c29ba\",\"review_text\":\"When you want to listen to a song, do it on Spotify.🤞\"},{\"review_id\":\"98036036-2a09-45dd-b4cf-e33c1576b9f9\",\"review_text\":\"why i don't have any lyrics?\"},{\"review_id\":\"1d3a1562-ec0f-49d5-8063-ddf8e799164e\",\"review_text\":\"A good app for exploring the world of music\"},{\"review_id\":\"2129d3ac-d7e6-4ee6-8088-f3b8728fa78b\",\"review_text\":\"Advancement over all.\"},{\"review_id\":\"ac4add65-a5ee-454b-8501-750c227497c6\",\"review_text\":\"App regularly cuts out during songs. Used to work perfectly. Have tried reinstalling. Using a Samsung A53a\"},{\"review_id\":\"e5a1a9b0-b01f-4e86-947d-e702609f1b27\",\"review_text\":\"The recent update really ruined the app\"},{\"review_id\":\"fd7f46d0-93cd-4bc2-8cce-b88e6d153d66\",\"review_text\":\"I hate this stupid app every time I try to listen to a song it plays a completely different one that's not even made by the same person\"},{\"review_id\":\"f8c4667d-7d25-42f7-9d28-c27a7bd39e67\",\"review_text\":\"Enjoyable app.\"}]}"
